cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, or any excerpt or adaptation of it, please cite
  both the software (this repository) and the WSBD paper listed under
  preferred-citation.
title: "Quadrant-Optimization: reference implementation of WSBD (Weighted Stochastic Block Descent)"
abstract: >-
  Research code for WSBD, a freezing-based optimizer for quantum neural
  networks, including PennyLane and Qiskit implementations and the VQE,
  MNIST, Fashion-MNIST, Parity and XOR benchmarks reported in the paper.
type: software
authors:
